You can ﬁnd the connection alias on the Connections tab on your domain dashboard.
• If you set up a connection between domain-a -> domain-b with connection alias
cluster_b and domain-a -> domain-c with connection alias cluster_c, search
domain-a, domain-b, and domain-c as follows:
GET https://src-domain.us-east-1.es.amazonaws.com/
local_index,cluster_b:b_index,cluster_c:c_index/_search
